{"name":"Pancake","hex":"#f7d788","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Pancake","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A surname."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Pancake"}],"entries":[{"title":"Pancake","blocks":[{"text":"A pancake, also known as a hotcake, griddlecake, or flapjack, is a flat type of batter bread like cake, often thin and round, prepared from a starch-based batter that may contain eggs, milk, and butter, and then cooked on a hot surface such as a griddle or frying pan. Archaeological evidence suggests that pancakes were probably eaten in prehistoric societies."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/40/Foodiesfeed.com_pouring-honey-on-pancakes-with-walnuts.jpg/330px-Foodiesfeed.com_pouring-honey-on-pancakes-with-walnuts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pancake","wikidata":"Q44541"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Alicha_1.jpg/500px-Alicha_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Alicha_1.jpg/500px-Alicha_1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"This meal of injera and several kinds of wat or tsebhi (stew) is typical of Ethiopian and Eritrean cuisine.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAlicha_1.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/LahohS.jpg/500px-LahohS.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/LahohS.jpg/500px-LahohS.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Lahoh is a staple in Somalia, Djibouti, and Yemen.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALahohS.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/